# Android TV Guidelines

## Scope & Constraints
- BitMusic TV target is built strictly for Android TV / Google TV large screen displays (minSdk 26, targetSdk 36, compileSdk 36).
- No touchscreen assumptions: all navigation must be 100% operable via D-pad remote controls.

## Build Commands
- Build Dev Debug APK:
  ```bash
  ./gradlew :tv:assembleDevDebug
  ```

## UI/UX Standards
- Clear visual focus indicators on all focusable elements.
- Support DPAD_UP, DPAD_DOWN, DPAD_LEFT, DPAD_RIGHT, DPAD_CENTER / ENTER, and BACK key events.
- Authentication should offer QR code login to avoid tedious on-screen keyboard text entry.
